# rules: csharp-missing-auth
# languages: c_sharp
# fixture: csharp/CWE-287.cs
# from: CWE-306 (Missing Authentication for Critical Function), CWE-287
#
# The rule reports an endpoint in a file that protects some of its others, and
# says nothing about a file that protects none. An application with no
# authentication anywhere has made a decision - the check may live in a filter,
# a gateway or a proxy, or it may be a sample with no accounts at all - and
# reporting every endpoint in it tells the reader nothing they did not know.
# What is a bug is the endpoint that was missed: a guard on three handlers and
# not on the fourth.
#
# There is one rule per language for this, and it reports under
# `<language>-missing-auth`. The corpus briefly carried two or three - an
# `-authn` spelling, an `-auth` spelling and this one - written against
# CWE-287, CWE-306 and CWE-862 but all asking the same question: is there an
# authentication guard on this endpoint. They fired on the same lines and a
# route with no middleware got three findings under three ids. Whether the
# missing guard is called authentication or authorization is not something the
# syntax says, so it is one finding; `<language>-862-rbac` is the separate rule
# for the endpoint that does authenticate and then checks no role.
#
# ASP.NET actions without [Authorize] allow anonymous access. The rule flags
# public controller actions that lack the attribute; safe actions include
# [Authorize] on the method.

. as $root
| ( ($root | scan_ast(["*.cs"]; [
      "public $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }",
      "public IActionResult $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }",
      "public ActionResult $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }",
      "[Authorize]\npublic $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }",
      "[Authorize] public $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }",
      "[Authorize($$$_)]\npublic $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }",
      "[Authorize($$$_)] public $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }",
      "[Authorize]"
    ])) as $all
    | ( $all | of(["public $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }","public IActionResult $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }","public ActionResult $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }"])
          | outside($all | of(["[Authorize]\npublic $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }","[Authorize] public $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }","[Authorize($$$_)]\npublic $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }","[Authorize($$$_)] public $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }"]))
          | in_files_with($all | of(["[Authorize]\npublic $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }","[Authorize] public $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }","[Authorize($$$_)]\npublic $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }","[Authorize($$$_)] public $R $M($$$_) { $$$BODY }"]))
        | finding("csharp-missing-auth";
            "Public action $M lacks [Authorize]; add it to require authentication") ) )
| report
